  -> the loudest channel is 13.8x the quietest one.
     One scale for the whole tensor is set by the loudest channel, so the quietest
     channel only gets 0.51 of INT4's 7 positive levels to work with.
  Within a single output channel, the loudest group of 128 is on average
     2.4x the quietest -- which is what per-group scales pick up.

